    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Update to 1.18.0

Upstream 1.18.0, which also carries 1.17.1. Both releases are model-surface
additions: reasoning_effort now accepts xhigh, and grok-4.6 and grok-4.5 were
added to ChatModel. No dependency floors changed -- the requires_dist sets of
1.17.0 and 1.18.0 are identical.

0001-proto-dispatch-support-protobuf-7-via-v6-gencode.patch is kept. It
routes protobuf &gt;= 6 to the v6 gencode so the package imports under
protobuf 7, and the upstream pull request carrying the same fix is still
open, so the patch is not yet droppable.

Source0 now spells the PyPI project directory xai_sdk rather than xai-sdk,
which is what spec-cleaner normalises to. Both spellings serve the identical
tarball (checked: same 453105-byte file), so this is cosmetic. The Requires
and Recommends block also moves above the test-requirements SECTION, again
spec-cleaner's ordering; no dependency was added, removed or changed.

Verified on aarch64: build green, 767 tests pass on each of python313 and
python314, rpmlint 0 errors / 0 warnings / 0 badness.</comment>
    <requestid>1370918</requestid>
  </revision>
